            "type": "text",
            "text": "Grey DK yarn, approx. 17 g. White DK yarn, approx. 5 g. Iridescent or purple DK yarn, approx. 2 g for the neck sheen. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Tapestry needle. Craft scissors. Soft measuring tape. Pair of 8 mm "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
